Found in the k17 job 1 audit (2026-11-13). ADR 0012: string positions reckon in UTF-16 code units. The Lexer counts code points for colno and the error Column. Oracle vs port: '😀😀{{ foo( }}' -> Column 13 (oracle) vs 11 (port); '😀😀{{ a b }}' -> Column 10 vs 8. Fix in Lexer.pm (k10 area) through the Lib UTF-16 seams (js_string_length & co., k17 job 1), oracle corpus case in lex/render-error mode.
